        <object label="&lt;b&gt;PUBLICATION AND QUERY OWNERSHIP&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14px;&quot;&gt;Packet loop updates scalar counters / monotonic timestamps.&lt;br&gt;The engine publishes once per second; transitions are coalesced.&lt;br&gt;COM readers clone an Arc; they never call back into the packet loop.&lt;br&gt;Security initialized once; class factory registered before SCM Running.&lt;br&gt;IDENTIFY (2) is the outgoing proxy default, not an incoming-token cap.&lt;/span&gt;" Source="src/runtime/status.rs; src/status_com.rs: initialize_security" tooltip="Source: src/runtime/status.rs; src/status_com.rs: initialize_security" id="snapshotNotes">
