        <object label="&lt;b&gt;SEPARATE AUTHENTICATION BOUNDARIES&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14px;&quot;&gt;UDP: optional configured BFD authentication&lt;br&gt;Status COM: authenticated Windows RPC caller token&lt;br&gt;BGP pipe: LocalService + enabled BFD service SID&lt;br&gt;Broker COM / MI: private Windows provider client&lt;br&gt;No ordinary-user status COM grant; no process-token fallback&lt;/span&gt;" Source="src/config.rs: Options::new; src/packet.rs: AuthConfig" tooltip="Source: src/config.rs: Options::new; src/packet.rs: AuthConfig" id="authNote">
