        <object id="reader" Source="installer/Package.wxs: ServiceSecurity; LogSecurity" tooltip="Authenticated users retain SCM queries and existing event/file log reads." label="&lt;b&gt;AUTHENTICATED LOCAL USER  |  read-only monitoring&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14px;&quot;&gt;Read Windows service status and configuration&lt;br&gt;Read event / file logs under their existing permissions&lt;br&gt;No Start / Stop, reconfiguration, or custom service controls&lt;/span&gt;">
          <mxCell style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;strokeWidth=1.5;fillColor=#D5E8D4;strokeColor=#82B366;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=15;fontColor=#172B4D;spacing=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
